      "text": "1. Weighted Signals\n   w per event type\n\n2. Time Decay\n   score = w × 2^(-age/h)\n\n3. Pattern Multipliers\n   Breadth (people)\n   Channel mix\n   Acceleration (spike)\n   Combo bonuses", "originalText": "1. Weighted Signals\n   w per event type\n\n2. Time Decay\n   score = w × 2^(-age/h)\n\n3. Pattern Multipliers\n   Breadth (people)\n   Channel mix\n   Acceleration (spike)\n   Combo bonuses",
